  "title": "Roof Damage Policy Change Request Form",
  "subtitle": "A decision-ready roof damage policy change request that preserves identity, facts, evidence, authorization, exceptions, and accountable handoff without replacing the controlling policy or qualified judgment.",
  "description": "An original roof damage policy change request for roof area, weather event, and interior water path with domain-specific intake, investigation, evidence, decision, escalation, audit, and closeout controls.",
  "use_case": "Use when the roof-loss claim and qualified inspection owner must open and control a policy change request for roof area, weather event, and interior water path. The record closes only after evidence and limitations are visible, authorized decisions are distinguishable from pending review, exceptions have owners, and the next recipient accepts the handoff.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
